      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近在城市裡不是可以\n看到很多污泥嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD1572857CE5E0288E14E0D662F53EF4EE5000A770B52305F88591A6C616CE555CEFF1F00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喏，就是像那樣的東西。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "558FFF0C5C31662F50CF90A36A2376846771897F300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我灰色的腦細胞靈光一閃，\n想到可以靠清污泥大撈一筆。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621170708272768481667D3080DE974851494E009583FF0C000A60F3523053EF4EE597606E056C616CE5592764884E007B46300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我猜鐵臂槍蝦應該對水槍很拿手，\n所以就和牠搭檔，準備要搞事業啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211731C943581C269CD876661C98A725C0D6C3469CD5F8862FF624BFF0C000A62404EE55C31548C7260642D6A94FF0C6E9650998981641E4E8B696D5566300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "結果啊，根本不行！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n鐵臂槍蝦這傢伙就是不肯\n幫我把污泥給洗掉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D50679C554AFF0C6839672C4E0D884CFF0100100001BE01000A943581C269CD8766901950A24F195C31662F4E0D80AF000A5E6B6211628A6C616CE57D666D176389300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗆蝦啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55C68766554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我有事要拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621167094E8B898162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓我的鐵臂槍蝦\n大開眼界一下吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n讓牠見識<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的寶可夢用水槍\n沖洗污泥的帥氣模樣！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B9362117684943581C269CD8766000A5927958B773C754C4E004E0B5427300200100001BE01000A8B937260898B8B5800100003110000FF01014F6059B376845BF653EF592275286C3469CD000A6C966D176C616CE576845E256C236A216A23FF0100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
