      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這下我知道你為什麼對污泥是\n連看一眼都不屑啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E0B621177E590534F6070BA4EC09EBC5C0D6C616CE5662F000A9023770B4E00773C90FD4E0D5C515566300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但也就是因為這樣！\n我倆要去清污泥嘍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
