      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55C68766554AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不只是清污泥！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我們還要用你那超凡的力量\n去挑戰寶可夢對戰的世界。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EA662F6E056C616CE5FF0100100001BE01000A621150119084898175284F6090A38D8551E17684529B91CF000A53BB631162305BF653EF59225C0D623076844E16754C300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我們放膽全都要，\n橫掃各界全拿第一吧！我的好搭檔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9362115011653E81BD516890FD8981FF0C000A6A6B63835404754C516862FF7B2C4E005427FF0162117684597D642D6A94300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
